    "short_description": "Escape Space is a classic arcade space shooter with RPG mechanics. Fight for various factions against swarms of enemies or bosses and improve your standings, level up your rank, unlock new gear and weapons, and upgrade your spaceship.",
    "supported_languages": "English, French",
    "reviews": "\u201cEscape Space is not just another indie space shooter, it's a testament to the fact that with passion and creativity, familiar genres can be reinvented, presenting something both new and nostalgically enticing.\u201d<br>Wala Wala Games<br><br>\u201cIt's everything you want from a good video game and Escape: Space is a good video game.\u201d<br>Jiti Corp<br>",
